  "prefLabel": "Res 5502.03 Appeals",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Res 5502.03 Appeals. If any landowner has been ordered by the director to undertake control measures on lands designated as control areas, the landowner may appeal the order by requesting a hearing pursuant to Res 200.\n\nSource. #8441, eff 10-1-05; ss by #10547, eff 3-21-14",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/res5200-5900.html"
